{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">熟悉的旋律痕迹再次浮现，琴声渐渐低落，仿佛一切激荡都将归于平静。可就在声音快要远去时，一股惊人的力量突然卷起。强劲的八度接连奔涌，一浪紧逼一浪，带着近乎无法遏止的冲力，把刚刚沉下去的情绪重新推向顶点。这不是新的挣扎，更像是所有尚未平息的感受，在最后一刻毫无保留地倾泻出来。紧接着，两声沉重而果断的和弦骤然落下，截断了翻腾的声浪，没有迟疑，也不再回望。余响仍在空气里震动，心里却慢慢安静下来。那份安定并不轻盈，甚至带着刚刚经历过的猛烈冲击。它不是遗忘，而是在一切都充分响过之后，终于能够坦然接受寂静。</", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-9384ecde58404c90bf732f852d96693f", "response_sha256": "14608fc90d076127640bbec81f52cf576a959fbb4e9c8ac7081624ea462cde52", "session_handle": "b05f14c7-c832-4628-b3c6-13d862d341e5", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.946, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.822}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 193, "first_assistant_seconds": 32.109, "first_text_seconds": 32.313, "stream_seconds": 41.422, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 186}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observa